TITLE:: SCVMeasurementBroker
summary:: Centralized measurement broker and subscription manager
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/SCVisuals, Classes/SCVLevelsSource

DESCRIPTION::
SCVMeasurementBroker acts as the central coordinator between audio-server analysis synths and graphical presentation widgets. It keys sources by server, measurement type, bus index, channel count, and update frequency.

When multiple visualizer windows (e.g. two meters or a dashboard) monitor the same bus, the broker shares a single analysis Synth and OSC responder rather than duplicating audio thread load.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: default
Returns the default singleton broker.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: subscribeLevels
Subscribes a consumer object to a peak and RMS level measurement source.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
An identifying object (e.g. view or symbol).

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busType
code::\outputs::, code::\inputs::, or code::\bus::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of audio channels.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Telemetry update frequency in Hz.

ARGUMENT:: onDataCallback
Function evaluated on AppClock when new measurement values arrive: code::{ |peaks, rms, peakHold, source| ... }::.

METHOD:: unsubscribe
Unsubscribes a consumer from a specific source key. If no consumers remain, the source is automatically stopped and freed.

METHOD:: unsubscribeAll
Unsubscribes a consumer from all active sources.

METHOD:: sourceCount
Returns the number of active sources.

METHOD:: freeAll
Frees all active sources and clears all subscriptions.
